    },
    "%lld books" : {
      "comment" : "A count of books standing alone, such as a library summary. %lld is the number of books.\nWhat a removal sentence calls the books it removes when none is named: a count of books, as in \"Moved 3 books to the Trash.\" %lld is how many.",
      "localizations" : {
