    },
    "Always" : {
      "comment" : "Text of the Library tab of Settings, a list of the views the Library window offers (built-in views and the listener's own). A visibility as the Visibility pop-up names it: \"Always\", \"When Applicable\", or \"Hidden\". This is the case .always."
    },
    "Always offers a view all the time. When Applicable offers it only while it lists something: the Reading List while it holds a book, an episode, or an article, and Feeds while there is a feed. Hidden leaves it out. A window showing a view keeps it until you choose another." : {
      "comment" : "Text of the Library tab of Settings, a list of the views the Library window offers (built-in views and the listener's own). What the three visibilities do, and that a window keeps its view."
    },
    "An edit of its text is kept beside the new reading, as a copy in the book's package." : {
      "comment" : "Text of Speak Info, Book Information's braille code and text encoding rows, and the re-read alerts. What a re-read does to text TextMouth did not write, said only for a book whose content.md holds such text: an edit made with Edit Text, or a save no edit took, either kept as Replace Existing keeps it (ImportDecisionWording.replacingKeepsTextSentence)."
    },
    "An unknown error occurred." : {
      "comment" : "Message of an alert about a problem, when nothing more is known about it."
    },
