      "comment" : "A command on a bookmark of the Bookmarks list, as a button beside its row, a VoiceOver action, and a context menu item: deletes the bookmark.\nText of the Library tab of Settings, a list of the views the Library window offers (built-in views and the listener's own). The question's button that deletes.",
