    "Feeds" : {
      "comment" : "Text of the Folder Settings sheet, which shows one library folder's facts and its listening options. The label of the feeds inside the folder, shown only when it has any.\nText of the Library view editor sheet, which makes and changes a view of the Library window, and of the descriptions of a view's filter. A kind of row as its checkbox names it: \"Books\", \"Episodes\", \"Articles\", or \"Feeds\". This is the case .feeds."
    },
    "Feeds are always listed by title" : {
      "comment" : "Text of the Library window's View pop-up and Go to View. The hint of that one item, which says why there is no other."
