    "Finished" : {
      "comment" : "How far a finished book has got, shown and spoken in place of its percent: in the library's row, Speak Info, Where Am I?, and Copy Reading Position.\nText of the Library view editor sheet, which makes and changes a view of the Library window, and of the descriptions of a view's filter. A reading state as the pop-up names it. This is the case .finished.",
