    "Read “%@” again automatically?" : {
      "comment" : "Text of Speak Info, Book Information's braille code and text encoding rows, and the re-read alerts. The title of the alert that asks before a book is read again as option says: \"Read “Ledger” again as Shift JIS (Japanese)?\", or \"Read “Ledger” again automatically?\". Placeholders in order: bookTitle."
    },
    "Reading List" : {
      "comment" : "Text of the Library view editor sheet, which makes and changes a view of the Library window, and of the descriptions of a view's filter. A kind of test as a condition's test pop-up names it. This is the case .inReadingList.\nThe start of the window title of a book read from the reading list, before a colon and the book's title, in place of \"Book\"; also the name of the Library's Reading List.",
