        }
      }
    },
    "The Library window's View pop-up offers these views, in this order. A new Library window opens at the first one it offers." : {
      "comment" : "Text of the Library tab of Settings, a list of the views the Library window offers (built-in views and the listener's own). What the list is, and where a new window opens."
    },
    "The book is in %@." : {
      "comment" : "Second sentence of the announcement after an import at the Reading List added one book to it: the library folder the book went to. %@ is the folder's path, such as Essays/Sea, or Library Root.",
