    },
    "The book is no longer in the library, so it was not read again." : {
      "comment" : "Text of Speak Info, Book Information's braille code and text encoding rows, and the re-read alerts. Why a book that left the library while its Book Information was open is not read again."
    },
    "The books are in %@." : {
      "comment" : "Second sentence of the announcement after an import at the Reading List added several books to it: the library folder they went to. %@ is the folder's path, such as Essays/Sea, or Library Root.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Los libros están en %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The braille is translated to print again with this code. Nothing checks that it is the right choice. If words read wrongly, choose another." : {
      "comment" : "Text of Speak Info, Book Information's braille code and text encoding rows, and the re-read alerts. What the alert says first: the braille is translated to print again with the code chosen, and nothing can tell whether it is the right one, since every braille text translates in every table, so a wrong one reads with no error."
    },
    "The download of “%@” will be deleted." : {
      "comment" : "First sentence of the confirmation that deletes one feed item's download. %@ is the episode's or article's title."
    },
    "The feed %@ stays, with its downloads, without a folder until Feed Info gives it another." : {
      "comment" : "Sentence of the second confirmation that deletes a folder: one feed stays. %@ is the feed's title in quotation marks. \"Feed Info\" names a sheet."
    },
    "The feeds %@ stay, with their downloads, without folders until Feed Info gives each another." : {
      "comment" : "Sentence of the second confirmation that deletes a folder: several feeds stay. %@ is a list of the feeds' titles in quotation marks. \"Feed Info\" names a sheet."
    },
    "The files that couldn't be read are listed." : {
      "comment" : "Sentence of the results of Compare Libraries saying the unread files are listed below."
    },
    "The folder %@ holds a different library, so nothing was compared." : {
