      "comment" : "Heading over the items of a folder that could not be removed from the library, several of them. One line for each follows."
    },
    "They are listed after the differences." : {
      "comment" : "Sentence of the results of Compare Libraries that follows the count of unread files: the files are listed after the differences."
    },
    "This Window" : {
      "comment" : "A choice of the Open the next book in pop-up button (Settings, Playback; Feed Info; Folder Settings): the next book opens in the window already open, in place of the book there.",
