    },
    "This braille looks like English Braille, American Edition. Choose its Braille Code in Book Information." : {
      "comment" : "Text of Speak Info, Book Information's braille code and text encoding rows, and the re-read alerts. What Book Information says under the pop-up of a braille book that is read as UEB but whose braille shows English Braille, American Edition's signs (BrailleCodeDetector): which code it looks like and where to choose it. Plain, so that VoiceOver and a braille display read it as it is."
    },
    "This folder holds another copy of the library TextMouth is using." : {
      "comment" : "First sentence of Use This Library's account of the folder the listener chose."
    },
    "This folder is no longer in the library." : {
      "comment" : "Text of the Folder Settings sheet, which shows one library folder's facts and its listening options. What the sheet says in place of the folder, when the folder was deleted in another window while the sheet was open."
    },
    "This item could not be deleted and remains in the library:" : {
      "comment" : "Heading over the one item of a folder that could not be deleted permanently. A line about it follows."
