    "Unopened" : {
      "comment" : "Text of Speak Info, Book Information's braille code and text encoding rows, and the re-read alerts. What a book's summary says of a book never opened.\nText of the Library view editor sheet, which makes and changes a view of the Library window, and of the descriptions of a view's filter. A reading state as the pop-up names it. This is the case .unopened."
    },
    "Unread: %@ couldn't be read (%@), %@" : {
